@capability:ui-page-landing
@root-scenario:ui-page-landing
Feature: Circuit Explorer landing
  The landing is declared as a scenario circuit: login entry, four provider-backed regions,
  the user-action lighting map and the provider drill-down flywheel.
  @scenario:ui-page-landing
  Scenario: Read and drive the landing circuit
    Given route /circuit/explorer with the declared query, session states and sources
    When the declared events dispatch navigate, select, session, observe, objective and local actions
    Then the read returns ui-page.v1 and each region subcircuit resolves AUTHORED or HELD
